  {
   "id": "a23-text-10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 128,
   "width": 703,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "How it works: mix old and new next hops, look for a cycle",
   "originalText": "How it works: mix old and new next hops, look for a cycle",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a23-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 933,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "After FRR, every router runs SPF and updates its table on its own time. Old next hops = the normal\ntables; new = the SPF without what is down (both with the lowest-id tie-break).",
   "originalText": "After FRR, every router runs SPF and updates its table on its own time. Old next hops = the normal\ntables; new = the SPF without what is down (both with the lowest-id tie-break).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a23-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 219,
   "width": 972,
   "height": 149,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  Each router R ≠ D is on its old next hop (waiting) or its new one (updated).\n•  A PLR (its old next hop is over the failure) has only its new one: until it updates, its FRR repair\n   carries the traffic past the others’ tables.\n•  Old ones alone never loop, nor new ones alone (both are SPF). So every loop needs some routers\n   updated and some waiting.\n•  Found breadth-first from each router whose next hop changes, so loops are short. A loop found twice\n   is listed once, starting at its lowest id.",
   "originalText": "•  Each router R ≠ D is on its old next hop (waiting) or its new one (updated).\n•  A PLR (its old next hop is over the failure) has only its new one: until it updates, its FRR repair\n   carries the traffic past the others’ tables.\n•  Old ones alone never loop, nor new ones alone (both are SPF). So every loop needs some routers\n   updated and some waiting.\n•  Found breadth-first from each router whose next hop changes, so loops are short. A loop found twice\n   is listed once, starting at its lowest id.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a23-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 378,
   "width": 160,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example 2, to E",
   "originalText": "Example 2, to E",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a23-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 412,
   "width": 432,
   "height": 113,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Router  Old next hop        New next hop\n------  ------------------  --------------------\nS       E (over S–E: PLR)   A   S-A-B-C-E = 4\nA       S   A-S-E = 2 < 3   B   A-B-C-E = 3\nB       C   B-C-E = 2       C\nC       E                   E",
   "originalText": "Router  Old next hop        New next hop\n------  ------------------  --------------------\nS       E (over S–E: PLR)   A   S-A-B-C-E = 4\nA       S   A-S-E = 2 < 3   B   A-B-C-E = 3\nB       C   B-C-E = 2       C\nC       E                   E",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a23-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 535,
   "width": 423,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "S updated (→ A), A waiting (→ S):  A → S → A\nS is a PLR among the updated: plrEarly = yes",
   "originalText": "S updated (→ A), A waiting (→ S):  A → S → A\nS is a PLR among the updated: plrEarly = yes",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a23-text-16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 585,
   "width": 914,
   "height": 20,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
