   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "What it doesn’t do",
   "originalText": "What it doesn’t do",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a23-text-51",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1125,
   "y": 850,
   "width": 496,
   "height": 85,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 403869,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5341179,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "It lists the loops some update order can make; it\ndoesn’t time the updates or pick an order. Loops\naway from a PLR need ordered FIB updates (RFC 6976),\nwhich aren’t modelled.",
   "originalText": "It lists the loops some update order can make; it\ndoesn’t time the updates or pick an order. Loops\naway from a PLR need ordered FIB updates (RFC 6976),\nwhich aren’t modelled.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a23-text-52",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1125,
   "y": 945,
   "width": 457,
   "height": 60,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 411788,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5445908,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A property test: every loop is a closed cycle of\nneighbors that never passes D and has a router that\nupdated.",
   "originalText": "A property test: every loop is a closed cycle of\nneighbors that never passes D and has a router that\nupdated.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
